flowchart LR
  W[Worker seat hits a decision] --> AP[approval.py request<br/>--from seat]
  AP --> DB[(approvals)]
  DB --> G[Gateway]
  G --> P[Phone card]
  G --> Wa[Watch card]
  G --> D[Dashboard]
  G --> T[Telegram]
  P -- tap answer --> G
  Wa -- tap answer --> G
  T -- reply --> G
  G -- resume --> M[(msg_store)]
  M -- inbox --> W2[Worker resumes<br/>with your answer]
